Preserve held gameplay actions in keyboard/mouse chords. Button mappings take
priority over a shared evade modifier, including left/right modifier aliases.
Suspend shoulder auto-repeat during stick movement or any multi-button chord;
reset the repeat delay when the protected interaction ends. This prevents the
input layer from dropping R2 while moving a crate or holding R2 + Cross.
Validated with synthetic production-pad tests; crate-scene gameplay remains a
separate acceptance check.

